{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "06PT", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-locally-quasi-finite}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6f10ebe65c8c8357419b5ce42493805b53e13c9648fed47acec82224b881dead", "source_text": "Locally quasi-finite morphisms", "source_text_hash": "sha256:076553f6e668bcf50cf161f7fbcc663717fe68d3757a62ec3853af1e67a91593", "unit_id": "tag:06PT:title"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06PT", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{section-local-source-target}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0c01d19575fcaa8328f515ce8f6b650d45ac625502c49f71a2e5817c747623b2", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe property ``locally quasi-finite'' of morphisms of algebraic spaces\nis not smooth local on the source-and-target so we cannot use the material in\nSection <REF_0001>\nto define locally quasi-finite morphisms of algebraic stacks.\nWe do already know what it means for a morphism of algebraic stacks\nrepresentable by algebraic spaces to be locally quasi-finite, see\nProperties of Stacks, Section\n<REF_0002>.\nTo find a condition suitable for general morphisms we make the following\nobservation.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7e217933a69abecdc323c2e57076c24b0bfd2ce3864fe9c57d58eed6903f5c63", "unit_id": "tag:06PT:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06PT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$\\Spec(k) \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0006": "$k$", "MATH_0007": "$|\\Spec(k) \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}|$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-representable-by-spaces-quasi-finite}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a0027fccf0dbffd142d4cf95b0d24c2c4bce02c59e66eea6105a25724e4a0332", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c566152bed7472cc6e9c119775d5765623c227f93217684bdfe9b80311ef1a73", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nAssume <MATH_0002> is representable by algebraic spaces.\nThe following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003> is locally quasi-finite (as in Properties of Stacks,\nSection <REF_0001>), and\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0004> is locally of finite type and for every morphism\n<MATH_0005> where <MATH_0006> is a field the\nspace <MATH_0007> is discrete.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7ad06b8d492d180db5574196b528df180e9bb58e82e8085778f0af7f02d77922", "unit_id": "tag:06UA:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06PT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}_k \\to \\Spec(k)$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$|\\mathcal{X}_k|$", "MATH_0004": "$V \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$V$", "MATH_0006": "$V \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to V$", "MATH_0007": "$V \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to V$", "MATH_0008": "$\\Spec(k) \\to V$", "MATH_0009": "$k$", "MATH_0010": "$$\n\\Spec(k) \\times_V (V \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}) =\n\\Spec(k) \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}\n$$", "MATH_0011": "$V \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to V$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-locally-quasi-finite}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{stacks-properties-lemma-check-property-covering}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-locally-quasi-finite}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a3e5e3c497e49575c3f7f72b2f6ff883e6ac4c395089878db7c75740084fb688", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1e598d5afb58bc0a311cfa62a7cd3d505cb8214732a4e54995d6f8436976b78e", "source_text": "Assume (1). In this case the morphism of algebraic spaces\n<MATH_0001> is locally quasi-finite as a base change\nof <MATH_0002>. Hence <MATH_0003> is discrete by\nMorphisms of Spaces, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nConversely, assume (2). Pick a surjective smooth morphism\n<MATH_0004> where <MATH_0005> is a scheme. It suffices to show that the\nmorphism of algebraic spaces <MATH_0006>\nis locally quasi-finite, see\nProperties of Stacks, Lemma\n<REF_0002>.\nThe morphism <MATH_0007> is locally of finite\ntype by assumption. For any morphism <MATH_0008> where <MATH_0009> is a\nfield\n<MATH_0010>\nhas a discrete space of points by assumption. Hence we conclude that\n<MATH_0011> is locally quasi-finite by\nMorphisms of Spaces, Lemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3b5824f6f64e07a5497ef973e6a59a3103cc80ec1a9603b9bd4843e3580be3f9", "unit_id": "tag:06UA:proof"}
